\b
\li1 
\v 17 the descendants of \zwd Bezai|\zwd*, 323; 
\b
\li1 
\v 18 the descendants of \zwd Jorah|\zwd*,\f + \fr 2:18 \ft Jorah is a variant of Hariph; see Nehemiah 7:24.\f* 112; 
