\b
\li1 
\v 20 the descendants of \zwd Gibbar|\zwd*,\f + \fr 2:20 \ft Gibbar is a variant of Gibeon; see Nehemiah 7:25.\f* 95; 
\b
\li1 
\v 21 the men \f + \fr 2:21 \ft Literally the sons; here and in verses 25, 26, 33, and 34\f* of Bethlehem, 123; 
\b
