\v 39 and the descendants of \zwd Harim|\zwd*, 1,017. 
\b
\m 
\v 40 The Levites: 
\b
\li1 the descendants of \zwd Jeshua|\zwd* and \zwd Kadmiel|\zwd* (through the line of \zwd Hodaviah|\zwd* \f + \fr 2:40 \ft Hodaviah is a variant of Hodevah; see Nehemiah 7:43.\f*), 74. 
\b
\m 
\v 41 The singers: 
\b
\li1 the descendants of \zwd Asaph|id="Q43280403" t="2"\zwd*, 128. 
\b
\m 
\v 42 The gatekeepers: 
\b
\li1 the descendants of \zwd Shallum|\zwd*, 
\b
\li1 the descendants of \zwd Ater|\zwd*, 
\b
\li1 the descendants of \zwd Talmon|id="Q139678428" t="2"\zwd*, 
\b
\li1 the descendants of \zwd Akkub|id="Q138713763" t="2"\zwd*, 
\b
\li1 the descendants of \zwd Hatita|\zwd*, 
\b
\li1 and the descendants of \zwd Shobai|id="Q139890037" t="2"\zwd*, 
\b
\li2 139 in all. 
\b
\m 
\v 43 The temple servants:\f + \fr 2:43 \ft Hebrew The Nethinim; also in verses 58 and 70\f* 
\b
